WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:53.660
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:53.930 --> 00:55.460
[Money]

3
00:55.490 --> 00:58.280
[Children]

4
00:58.320 --> 01:00.840
[Official]

5
01:00.860 --> 01:03.360
[Blessing]

6
01:10.400 --> 01:11.530
Whoever wrote this,

7
01:11.610 --> 01:13.539
follow them to see where they live.

8
01:25.840 --> 01:26.930
Who wrote this?

9
01:26.250 --> 01:27.970
[The Zhang family will die a horrible death!]

10
01:28.000 --> 01:30.180
[Fortune Telling]

11
01:30.210 --> 01:32.570
[Li Yingjuan]

12
01:45.120 --> 01:46.810
Wish you longevity.

13
01:47.400 --> 01:48.640
Are you here for divination

14
01:48.640 --> 01:49.920
or for the talisman?

15
01:50.039 --> 01:50.840
Master,

16
01:50.920 --> 01:51.870
my surname is Li.

17
01:52.070 --> 01:54.150
I want to invite you to my house to perform a ritual.

18
01:54.150 --> 01:55.120
Sure.

19
01:55.240 --> 01:56.190
What is it for?

20
01:56.470 --> 01:58.330
My niece is getting married soon.

21
01:58.550 --> 01:59.470
To read their Four Pillars of Destiny?

22
01:59.470 --> 02:00.280
No problem.

23
02:00.830 --> 02:01.600
No, no.

24
02:01.600 --> 02:03.730
I want you to come to my house and help me

25
02:04.160 --> 02:05.550
break them up.

26
02:05.640 --> 02:06.470
Well...

27
02:06.750 --> 02:08.039
It's better to destroy ten temples

28
02:08.039 --> 02:09.270
than one marriage.

29
02:09.430 --> 02:10.320
Please

30
02:10.520 --> 02:12.110
don't make it difficult for me.

31
02:12.110 --> 02:14.370
None of the Zhang family are good people!

32
02:18.710 --> 02:20.430
They want to kill my niece.

33
02:21.540 --> 02:23.050
They want to...

34
02:23.079 --> 02:24.600
trap her soul.

35
02:25.870 --> 02:27.920
She's my only relative left.

36
02:27.920 --> 02:29.240
I can't watch her

37
02:29.240 --> 02:30.960
jump into a fire pit.

38
02:31.110 --> 02:32.800
Why won't she listen to me?

39
02:32.800 --> 02:34.670
She thinks I'm trying to harm her!

40
02:34.670 --> 02:36.079
How could I...

41
02:36.210 --> 02:38.020
I have indeed heard of

42
02:38.050 --> 02:40.520
the soul-trapping ritual to change one's fate.

43
02:40.520 --> 02:42.320
But this ritual is extremely wicked

44
02:42.320 --> 02:43.760
and rarely done.

45
02:43.960 --> 02:44.800
Ma'am,

46
02:45.670 --> 02:47.040
how can you be sure

47
02:47.200 --> 02:49.079
that family did this ritual?

48
02:49.920 --> 02:50.829
Because

49
02:52.590 --> 02:53.430
our Li family

50
02:56.670 --> 02:58.360
did it before.

51
02:59.110 --> 03:01.200
The one trapped was from the Zhang family.

52
03:01.200 --> 03:02.670
What a sin.

53
03:02.920 --> 03:04.430
If we keep repaying one wrong with another,

54
03:04.430 --> 03:06.390
when will this cycle of vengeance ever end?

55
03:06.390 --> 03:07.480
So...

56
03:09.240 --> 03:09.760
Master,

57
03:09.990 --> 03:10.760
please,

58
03:10.760 --> 03:11.550
help me.

59
03:11.710 --> 03:12.240
Alright?

60
03:12.240 --> 03:13.670
We are willing to pay any amount.

61
03:13.670 --> 03:15.070
It's not about the money.

62
03:15.480 --> 03:17.010
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

63
03:17.360 --> 03:19.710
We've been exorcising demons for 20 years.

64
03:19.710 --> 03:20.760
We know our craft,

65
03:20.760 --> 03:22.079
and we get results.

66
03:22.360 --> 03:24.590
We'll take your case.

67
03:25.590 --> 03:26.079
Thank you!

68
03:26.079 --> 03:27.079
Thank you, Master!

69
03:27.079 --> 03:27.670
Thank you so much!

70
03:27.670 --> 03:28.670
Thank you so much!

71
03:28.670 --> 03:30.240
Then we are saved!

72
03:30.240 --> 03:31.320
Thank you.

73
03:31.320 --> 03:32.550
Thank you, Master.

74
03:32.800 --> 03:34.040
Thank you.

75
03:35.270 --> 03:36.390
Thank you.

76
03:40.110 --> 03:41.320
The Zhang family is where they are today

77
03:41.320 --> 03:44.480
because the soul-trapping ritual boosted their business.

78
03:44.480 --> 03:46.390
They hired an evil Taoist to perform the ritual.

79
03:46.390 --> 03:48.360
Once our Li Ling marries into their family,

80
03:48.360 --> 03:50.240
they will stuff her alive into a vat

81
03:50.240 --> 03:52.760
full of talisman water

82
03:53.240 --> 03:55.480
to trap her soul,

83
03:55.480 --> 03:57.670
so she can never be reincarnated.

84
04:00.870 --> 04:02.800
Have you heard of the soul-trapping ritual?

85
04:02.800 --> 04:04.630
I've heard of it, but never seen it.

86
04:04.630 --> 04:05.620
That requires killing.

87
04:05.620 --> 04:06.750
But we don't do that.

88
04:08.600 --> 04:09.930
Let's take a look first.

89
04:57.790 --> 04:58.909
Come on.

90
04:59.000 --> 05:00.390
There's nothing here.

91
05:00.560 --> 05:01.820
That old lady was so weird.

92
05:01.820 --> 05:04.190
I guess she has a problem here.

93
07:25.670 --> 07:29.500
[A Prophet]

94
07:30.170 --> 07:32.640
[Episode 19]

95
07:33.640 --> 07:34.880
You think I can't catch you?

96
07:34.880 --> 07:36.270
You little thing!

97
07:39.790 --> 07:40.880
If I catch you,

98
07:40.880 --> 07:42.390
I'll make you into

99
07:42.390 --> 07:43.830
spicy chicken!

100
07:49.560 --> 07:51.030
You really made me angry.

101
07:51.030 --> 07:51.960
I'm telling you.

102
08:00.210 --> 08:00.970
Oh my.

103
08:01.000 --> 08:02.600
It's the Sect Master's room.

104
08:08.120 --> 08:09.560
Why is there a coffin?

105
08:14.250 --> 08:18.380
[Tomb of Shangguan Chengming]

106
08:15.440 --> 08:16.270
Shang...

107
08:17.590 --> 08:18.790
Four character‌s?

108
08:18.880 --> 08:19.910
Who is it?

109
08:20.230 --> 08:20.830
Master.

110
08:25.760 --> 08:26.440
Master.

111
08:26.640 --> 08:27.520
I put it here.

112
08:28.830 --> 08:29.640
This thing

113
08:29.640 --> 08:30.350
was...

114
08:30.420 --> 08:32.549
brought from Pangzhou by Chief Batou.

115
08:33.110 --> 08:34.309
It was a long journey.

116
08:34.409 --> 08:36.570
I'm afraid someone tampered with it.

117
08:37.230 --> 08:39.159
How about we open it and take a look?

118
08:42.110 --> 08:42.870
No rush.

119
08:44.440 --> 08:45.710
Shangguan Chengming.

120
08:47.710 --> 08:49.840
Do you think this Shangguan Chengming

121
08:50.470 --> 08:51.830
could be my son?

122
08:52.200 --> 08:53.280
To be honest,

123
08:53.630 --> 08:56.080
this kid doesn't look like you at all.

124
08:57.080 --> 08:58.610
I don't think he's your son.

125
08:59.710 --> 09:01.110
It's so mysterious.

126
09:03.870 --> 09:05.320
Did Li Yingjuan find him?

127
09:05.630 --> 09:06.630
They...

128
09:11.440 --> 09:12.160
Didn't you hear that?

129
09:12.160 --> 09:13.280
That was a rooster crowing.

130
09:13.280 --> 09:13.800
Let's go.

131
09:13.800 --> 09:15.280
Let's talk inside.

132
09:16.800 --> 09:18.800
Where did this chicken come from?

133
09:37.590 --> 09:38.920
Are you keeping a vigil?

134
09:41.470 --> 09:42.920
You didn't sleep all night?

135
09:42.920 --> 09:43.680
I did.

136
09:44.520 --> 09:45.870
Just couldn't fall asleep.

137
09:45.870 --> 09:46.750
What's wrong?

138
09:47.470 --> 09:48.280
Something on your mind?

139
09:48.280 --> 09:49.110
No.

140
09:49.350 --> 09:49.960
Nothing at all.

141
09:49.960 --> 09:51.560
Then why are you sitting on my bed holding a chicken?

142
09:51.560 --> 09:53.350
It's my guardian now.

143
09:55.040 --> 09:56.040
Then keep your guardian away from me.

144
09:56.040 --> 09:56.710
No can do.

145
09:57.400 --> 09:58.990
I'm counting on it to make me some money

146
09:58.990 --> 10:00.160
so I can get a wife.

147
10:01.320 --> 10:02.710
Do you even have a girlfriend?

148
10:02.710 --> 10:03.960
Talking about getting a wife.

149
10:03.960 --> 10:05.350
Of course I do.

150
10:05.710 --> 10:07.560
We've been together for a while now.

151
10:07.560 --> 10:09.280
How come I've never seen her?

152
10:09.710 --> 10:10.510
Is she a fairy?

153
10:10.870 --> 10:11.920
Nonsense.

154
10:11.920 --> 10:12.800
So you don't have one!

155
10:12.800 --> 10:13.510
I do!

156
10:13.510 --> 10:14.510
I might as well tell you,

157
10:14.510 --> 10:15.560
her name is Liu Xijiao.

158
10:15.560 --> 10:16.870
She really looks like a fairy,

159
10:16.870 --> 10:18.400
like the ones in the murals.

160
10:18.400 --> 10:19.440
When she was standing there,

161
10:19.440 --> 10:20.230
Chen, who sells jelly noodles,

162
10:20.230 --> 10:21.630
couldn't even take his eyes off her.

163
10:21.630 --> 10:22.280
It's rea—

164
10:23.040 --> 10:24.200
Master!

165
10:25.400 --> 10:26.190
Master!

166
10:26.210 --> 10:28.010
Sounds like that crazy old lady.

167
10:29.830 --> 10:31.110
Don't move. I'll go.

168
10:31.110 --> 10:32.510
Watch my guardian for me.

169
10:36.400 --> 10:37.680
Shangguan Chengming.

170
10:39.080 --> 10:40.510
I've been thinking,

171
10:40.710 --> 10:43.110
you shouldn't be running scams these days.

172
10:43.230 --> 10:44.440
Just lay low.

173
10:55.040 --> 10:56.160
Master!

174
10:56.160 --> 10:57.350
Coming.

175
10:59.320 --> 10:59.830
Master!

176
10:59.830 --> 11:00.350
Ma'am.

177
11:00.350 --> 11:01.200
Look!

178
11:01.200 --> 11:02.400
Look at my arms.

179
11:02.400 --> 11:03.960
My niece and I are both like this.

180
11:03.960 --> 11:05.510
We were scratched by ghosts!

181
11:05.510 --> 11:07.230
The Zhang family must be trying to trap our souls.

182
11:07.230 --> 11:09.470
They want to take our souls away!

183
11:09.750 --> 11:10.990
What should we do?

184
11:10.990 --> 11:13.440
This is quite serious.

185
11:13.630 --> 11:16.280
As they say, only a century-old evil ghost

186
11:16.280 --> 11:19.080
can show its form.

187
11:19.080 --> 11:20.350
What should we do?

188
11:20.350 --> 11:21.630
Master, please save us!

189
11:21.630 --> 11:23.160
Please save us!

190
11:23.160 --> 11:24.440
Don't panic.

191
11:24.440 --> 11:25.800
Don't panic.

192
11:25.800 --> 11:26.560
This indeed

193
11:26.560 --> 11:28.960
can't be cured with just a few doses of medicine.

194
11:28.960 --> 11:31.200
I need to go to your residence

195
11:31.320 --> 11:33.800
and perform an exorcism for the whole house.

196
11:34.440 --> 11:35.200
Here's the plan.

197
11:35.200 --> 11:37.510
I'll go get some evil-warding artifacts first.

198
11:37.510 --> 11:38.280
Wait for me here.

199
11:38.280 --> 11:38.920
I'll be right back.

200
11:38.920 --> 11:39.560
Okay.

201
11:39.560 --> 11:40.710
Okay, Master.

202
11:44.710 --> 11:45.800
What are you doing?

203
11:45.920 --> 11:48.990
I can handle this scam myself.

204
11:49.020 --> 11:50.620
Sit down.

205
11:54.200 --> 11:54.990
But honestly,

206
11:54.990 --> 11:56.990
I really can't handle

207
11:56.990 --> 11:59.040
this situation.

208
11:59.280 --> 12:00.750
You gotta help me.

209
12:00.750 --> 12:01.750
I'm telling you,

210
12:01.750 --> 12:03.710
the scratches on that old lady's arm...

211
12:03.710 --> 12:05.800
I heard you guys talking just now.

212
12:05.920 --> 12:06.920
That old lady

213
12:07.280 --> 12:08.510
was bitten by a bug.

214
12:08.510 --> 12:09.470
A bug?

215
12:10.150 --> 12:11.640
There's a bug called the Ghost Crawler.

216
12:11.640 --> 12:13.570
Its bite marks look just like that.

217
12:14.000 --> 12:15.170
But

218
12:15.190 --> 12:17.320
these bugs don't usually appear indoors.

219
12:17.320 --> 12:19.920
Maybe someone is playing tricks.

220
12:20.230 --> 12:21.400
Whether someone is playing tricks or not,

221
12:21.400 --> 12:22.590
I've already taken the money.

222
12:22.590 --> 12:24.230
I have to fix this for her.

223
12:24.560 --> 12:25.890
What am I supposed to do?

224
12:30.080 --> 12:31.210
What does this mean?

225
12:45.710 --> 12:47.230
Spirits of heaven,

226
12:47.680 --> 12:48.990
spirits of earth,

227
12:49.160 --> 12:51.280
demons and monsters, hear my decree.

228
12:51.960 --> 12:54.360
Dogs bark in the east, cats meow in the west,

229
12:54.400 --> 12:56.830
the Day-Wandering God knows best.

230
12:56.990 --> 12:59.400
Copper bells pin down the headless demon!

231
13:00.680 --> 13:04.040
Incense ash mixed with wine breaks the spell.

232
13:18.400 --> 13:19.200
Open!

233
13:29.210 --> 13:30.130
Aunt!

234
13:30.400 --> 13:31.920
Why did you bring another scammer home?

235
13:31.920 --> 13:33.830
Look at this place. It's a smoky mess.

236
13:33.830 --> 13:34.400
Oh my!

237
13:34.400 --> 13:35.590
Stop talking nonsense!

238
13:35.590 --> 13:36.990
You are being too rude!

239
13:36.990 --> 13:39.110
Master, please don't mind her.

240
13:40.040 --> 13:40.800
Look,

241
13:40.800 --> 13:41.590
Master.

242
13:41.590 --> 13:42.750
Look at her arm.

243
13:42.750 --> 13:44.200
Look at her legs!

244
13:44.200 --> 13:45.350
Aunt, I study medicine.

245
13:44.940 --> 13:47.440
[Li Ling]

246
13:45.350 --> 13:46.590
How could I not know this?

247
13:46.590 --> 13:47.800
These are just bug bites.

248
13:47.800 --> 13:50.040
How could I not know if they are bug bites or not?

249
13:50.040 --> 13:52.710
This happened to me over 20 years ago.

250
13:52.710 --> 13:54.320
These are ghost scratches.

251
13:54.320 --> 13:55.710
I didn't pay attention back then.

252
13:55.710 --> 13:57.920
Then I almost died at the Zhangs'.

253
13:58.350 --> 13:58.990
Get out of here right now.

254
13:58.990 --> 13:59.990
Or I'll report you to the authorities.

255
13:59.990 --> 14:00.350
Get out.

256
14:00.350 --> 14:01.320
Li Ling!

257
14:01.320 --> 14:03.320
Maybe I should have the authorities throw you in jail.

258
14:03.320 --> 14:04.470
Let's see how they can marry you there!

259
14:04.470 --> 14:05.440
Aunt!

260
14:14.630 --> 14:15.590
Master,

261
14:15.990 --> 14:17.200
please forgive us.

262
14:17.870 --> 14:18.800
It's fine.

263
14:19.070 --> 14:19.900
Please.

264
14:36.160 --> 14:38.400
Listen well, you evil spirits!

265
14:38.510 --> 14:41.320
The Boundless Heavenly Lord is here today.

266
14:41.800 --> 14:43.800
Dare not harm the innocent again.

267
14:43.990 --> 14:46.080
If you dare to come again,

268
14:46.280 --> 14:48.920
I will ask the Celestial Master

269
14:49.040 --> 14:52.200
to scatter your souls himself.

270
15:33.110 --> 15:35.750
Lord of the Red Feather!

271
15:49.620 --> 15:50.530
You may rise.

272
15:52.960 --> 15:53.830
Ma'am,

273
15:53.990 --> 15:56.120
have any strangers visited recently?

274
15:56.160 --> 15:56.990
No,

275
15:57.440 --> 15:58.360
absolutely not.

276
15:58.360 --> 16:01.150
Any movement from the Zhang family?

277
16:01.440 --> 16:02.630
They are preparing for the wedding.

278
16:02.630 --> 16:04.750
A lot of people are coming and going.

279
16:04.920 --> 16:06.780
They didn't come looking for you?

280
16:07.470 --> 16:08.350
Master,

281
16:10.510 --> 16:11.560
do you think

282
16:11.680 --> 16:13.280
the Zhang family did this?

283
16:13.630 --> 16:14.630
The Zhang family?

284
16:17.770 --> 16:22.040
[Zhang Residence]

285
17:16.030 --> 17:16.960
Where is he?

286
17:17.990 --> 17:19.599
Where did he go?

287
17:27.839 --> 17:28.840
What's going on?

288
17:29.600 --> 17:30.710
What's going on?

289
17:44.070 --> 17:45.030
Liang.

290
17:47.400 --> 17:48.470
Liang.

291
17:49.840 --> 17:50.840
Xijiao?

292
17:50.930 --> 17:52.140
Liang.

293
17:52.230 --> 17:53.270
Xijiao.

294
17:53.510 --> 17:54.470
Xijiao.

295
17:54.790 --> 17:55.640
Liang,

296
17:55.790 --> 17:56.360
what's wrong?

297
17:56.360 --> 17:57.960
I missed you so much, Xijiao.

298
17:58.200 --> 17:59.470
Liang?

299
17:59.470 --> 18:00.200
Xijiao...

300
18:00.200 --> 18:01.360
Liang, what's wrong?

301
18:01.360 --> 18:02.230
Xijiao...

302
18:02.600 --> 18:03.680
Wake up!

303
18:03.920 --> 18:05.310
Liang, wake up!

304
18:05.310 --> 18:05.750
Xijiao...

305
18:05.750 --> 18:06.680
Liang!

306
18:06.750 --> 18:07.510
Xijiao.

307
18:07.880 --> 18:09.790
Liang, wake up!

308
18:09.960 --> 18:11.400
You've been drugged!

309
18:11.710 --> 18:13.070
Liang, wake up!

310
18:13.070 --> 18:14.310
Liang!

311
18:14.400 --> 18:15.470
No, no, no!

312
18:15.470 --> 18:16.550
Liang!

313
18:16.680 --> 18:17.400
Liang!

314
18:17.650 --> 18:18.120
Liang...

315
18:18.120 --> 18:18.840
Xijiao.

316
18:18.840 --> 18:19.440
Liang!

317
18:19.440 --> 18:21.160
Xijiao.

318
18:21.860 --> 18:22.580
Xijiao.

319
18:22.960 --> 18:24.690
Liang, are you feeling better?

320
18:24.750 --> 18:25.310
Liang.

321
18:26.400 --> 18:27.000
Xijiao...

322
18:44.710 --> 18:45.400
Liang.

323
18:45.470 --> 18:46.600
My chest is so tight.

324
18:46.620 --> 18:47.820
I feel like I'm dying.

325
18:48.400 --> 18:49.270
I can't breathe.

326
18:49.270 --> 18:49.880
Liang!

327
18:50.100 --> 18:51.230
-I can't breathe. -Liang.

328
18:51.230 --> 18:53.360
I'm burning up.

329
18:58.070 --> 18:58.880
Xijiao.

330
19:00.070 --> 19:00.920
Xijiao...

331
19:01.530 --> 19:03.150
[Liu Xijiao]

332
19:02.160 --> 19:03.030
Xijiao...

333
19:04.270 --> 19:05.160
Xijiao...

334
19:06.750 --> 19:08.120
I miss you so much.

335
19:30.400 --> 19:31.230
What are you hiding?

336
19:31.230 --> 19:32.110
Nothing.

337
19:40.440 --> 19:41.470
Let me see.

338
19:43.600 --> 19:46.470
I just wrote it randomly.

339
19:50.440 --> 19:52.240
I was just saying that casually.

340
19:52.470 --> 19:54.600
You're actually learning to write it?

341
19:54.640 --> 19:56.230
What did you bring me?

342
20:03.830 --> 20:05.170
You managed to write "Liu" and "Jiao,"

343
20:05.170 --> 20:07.280
the two difficult characters.

344
20:07.790 --> 20:09.510
Why can't you write "Xi"?

345
20:09.960 --> 20:11.510
I learned the hard ones first.

346
20:11.510 --> 20:13.120
From hard to easy.

347
20:13.380 --> 20:15.110
This pig trotter is delicious.

348
20:16.030 --> 20:16.880
How about I teach you?

349
20:16.880 --> 20:17.510
Okay.

350
20:21.070 --> 20:22.070
Look.

351
20:22.200 --> 20:24.470
First there's a heart.

352
20:24.960 --> 20:27.600
And on the right, there's a house.

353
20:29.470 --> 20:31.200
Then a "sun" at the bottom.

354
20:33.270 --> 20:34.640
Got it!

355
20:35.920 --> 20:37.030
It means

356
20:37.600 --> 20:38.880
the two of us,

357
20:39.310 --> 20:40.440
of one mind,

358
20:40.440 --> 20:42.200
moving into a house

359
20:42.510 --> 20:44.200
and living together.

360
20:46.070 --> 20:46.680
Right?

361
20:51.360 --> 20:53.620
I can't help you if you can't remember it.

362
20:54.160 --> 20:55.840
I won't be able to teach you in the future.

363
20:55.840 --> 20:56.880
Why?

364
21:01.750 --> 21:02.990
I'm getting married.

365
21:07.290 --> 21:08.490
Who are you marrying?

366
21:09.270 --> 21:10.460
They didn't tell me.

367
21:11.750 --> 21:13.400
The sect arranged it all.

368
21:13.480 --> 21:15.890
They said he's quite old,

369
21:16.120 --> 21:17.780
but his family has some money.

370
21:18.160 --> 21:21.030
The sect must have sold me for a good price.

371
21:25.550 --> 21:26.710
I've made some money,

372
21:26.710 --> 21:27.990
enough to buy a sow,

373
21:27.990 --> 21:29.270
but not enough for a boar yet.

374
21:29.270 --> 21:30.710
But I know where they sell them.

375
21:30.710 --> 21:31.960
Then I'll mate them,

376
21:31.960 --> 21:33.310
and they'll have a bunch of piglets,

377
21:33.310 --> 21:34.790
so we can make more money.

378
21:34.790 --> 21:36.470
Stay in the sect and work hard.

379
21:37.120 --> 21:38.800
Save more of your earnings.

380
21:42.520 --> 21:43.780
You'll definitely...

381
21:47.800 --> 21:51.660
You'll definitely find a better woman than me to be your wife someday.

382
22:04.640 --> 22:05.550
That's true.

383
22:08.920 --> 22:10.310
With my current skills,

384
22:10.550 --> 22:12.310
I can't even afford pig trotters.

385
22:12.310 --> 22:13.640
At least the man you're going to marry

386
22:13.640 --> 22:14.310
is rich.

387
22:14.790 --> 22:16.350
He can buy you trotters

388
22:16.960 --> 22:18.750
and give you a good life.

389
22:29.710 --> 22:31.910
Let's both take good care of ourselves.

390
22:54.580 --> 22:55.840
Take care of yourself.

391
22:59.350 --> 23:01.810
[Liu Xijiao]

392
23:02.420 --> 23:05.470
[Liang]

393
23:12.030 --> 23:12.880
You're awake?

394
23:13.550 --> 23:14.790
Why are you here?

395
23:14.840 --> 23:16.040
Good thing I was here.

396
23:16.160 --> 23:16.990
The poison you got

397
23:16.990 --> 23:18.440
could only be cleansed with water.

398
23:18.440 --> 23:19.400
How is it?

399
23:19.680 --> 23:20.640
Feeling better?

400
23:20.640 --> 23:21.600
Much better.

401
23:21.900 --> 23:23.940
I was set up by that guy.

402
23:28.160 --> 23:29.070
Leave now.

403
23:29.200 --> 23:30.030
Didn't I say

404
23:30.060 --> 23:32.200
I was going to make money on my own this time?

405
23:32.200 --> 23:33.920
I just saved you.

406
23:34.200 --> 23:35.360
And now

407
23:35.640 --> 23:38.370
you're telling me to leave the moment you wake up?

408
23:38.710 --> 23:40.070
But seriously, Liang.

409
23:40.650 --> 23:41.990
You really have a girlfriend

410
23:41.990 --> 23:43.230
named Liu Xijiao?

411
23:43.820 --> 23:46.020
I heard you muttering her name just now.

412
23:46.120 --> 23:48.070
My love is already dead.

413
23:48.840 --> 23:50.700
There's nothing to mutter about.

414
23:51.750 --> 23:53.510
You didn't just mutter about Liu Xijiao.

415
23:53.510 --> 23:54.970
You muttered about me too.

416
23:55.270 --> 23:56.470
You said something...

417
23:56.470 --> 23:57.710
about a coffin.

418
23:58.920 --> 24:00.120
What else did I say?

419
24:00.310 --> 24:01.680
You said everything—

420
24:01.710 --> 24:04.110
things you should and shouldn't have said.

421
24:07.360 --> 24:09.030
Well, I...

422
24:09.060 --> 24:10.140
Let me ask you,

423
24:10.400 --> 24:12.460
are you really the Sect Master's son?

424
24:14.880 --> 24:15.270
I...

425
24:15.270 --> 24:16.000
Don't say it!

426
24:16.350 --> 24:17.550
I have a loose tongue.

427
24:18.400 --> 24:19.640
Whether you are or not,

428
24:19.640 --> 24:21.160
you're still my brother.

429
24:22.440 --> 24:23.920
Let me tell you the truth.

430
24:24.310 --> 24:25.120
The Sect Master found

431
24:25.120 --> 24:26.750
Shangguan Chengming's coffin somewhere.

432
24:26.750 --> 24:27.880
So he suspects you're not his son.

433
24:27.880 --> 24:29.440
Then he set up a trap for you.

434
24:29.440 --> 24:30.840
I didn't want you to get involved,

435
24:30.840 --> 24:31.680
so I tried to stop you from coming.

436
24:31.680 --> 24:32.740
Do you understand?

437
24:34.650 --> 24:37.040
This is Shangguan Chengming's coffin.

438
24:37.230 --> 24:39.990
The Sect Master got it last night.

439
24:39.990 --> 24:42.650
Since the coffin arrived at the sect last night,

440
24:42.730 --> 24:44.190
why hasn't the Sect Master

441
24:44.510 --> 24:46.160
sent anyone to find me yet?

442
24:46.310 --> 24:48.110
He is the Sect Master, after all.

443
24:49.680 --> 24:51.360
While you were setting a trap for him,

444
24:51.360 --> 24:53.880
he was actually setting one for you.

445
24:54.160 --> 24:55.710
The Sect Master often says

446
24:56.030 --> 24:57.750
that everyone has a weakness.

447
24:58.120 --> 24:59.440
Grasping their weakness

448
24:59.440 --> 25:00.780
is equivalent to

449
25:00.800 --> 25:02.330
having leverage over them.

450
25:02.350 --> 25:03.740
Do you have a weakness?

451
25:05.880 --> 25:06.840
I don't.

452
25:08.230 --> 25:10.690
How are things between you and Jiang Feiyan?

453
25:14.120 --> 25:14.920
Liang,

454
25:15.930 --> 25:17.260
since I'm here,

455
25:17.500 --> 25:18.650
I won't leave.

456
25:20.230 --> 25:21.750
Nor will I abandon you.

457
25:23.710 --> 25:24.750
My good brother.

458
25:26.440 --> 25:27.230
Oh, right.

459
25:28.070 --> 25:28.880
That master

460
25:29.310 --> 25:30.370
is no ordinary man.

461
25:30.550 --> 25:32.510
It seems what happened to the Li family

462
25:32.510 --> 25:34.710
was indeed related to the Zhang family.

463
25:35.160 --> 25:37.030
Then where did this master go?

464
25:37.710 --> 25:38.770
But why do you think

465
25:38.880 --> 25:40.920
he came to this wilderness?

466
25:48.230 --> 25:49.230
Mountain peaks rise in a chain,

467
25:49.230 --> 25:50.960
with clouds winding around their waists

468
25:50.960 --> 25:53.750
and a clear stream meandering through the valleys—

469
25:53.750 --> 25:55.610
this is a land with good feng shui.

470
25:57.160 --> 25:58.270
Feng shui

471
25:58.270 --> 25:59.600
is about wind and water.

472
26:00.750 --> 26:01.790
Can you walk now?

473
26:01.880 --> 26:03.070
No problem.

474
26:03.310 --> 26:03.920
Let's go.

475
26:04.360 --> 26:05.760
Let's check downstream.

476
26:26.160 --> 26:27.440
Li Ling?

477
26:27.510 --> 26:28.440
Li Ling?

478
26:29.070 --> 26:30.800
She's Mrs. Li's niece, I think.

479
26:30.820 --> 26:31.470
Get out of here right now.

480
26:31.470 --> 26:32.470
Or I'll report you to the authorities.

481
26:32.470 --> 26:32.840
Get out.

482
26:32.840 --> 26:33.750
Li Ling!

483
26:33.750 --> 26:35.840
Maybe I should have the authorities throw you in jail.

484
26:35.840 --> 26:36.960
Let's see how they can marry you there!

485
26:36.960 --> 26:38.160
Aunt!

486
26:39.730 --> 26:43.390
This paper figure looks like the work of the sect's spiritual con.

487
26:43.790 --> 26:44.990
When I was performing the ritual at the Li family...

488
26:44.990 --> 26:45.440
Master.

489
26:45.440 --> 26:46.160
I found that Mrs. Li

490
26:46.160 --> 26:47.560
wasn't that crazy.

491
26:47.580 --> 26:48.510
Oh, right.

492
26:48.990 --> 26:49.840
You were right about one thing.

493
26:49.840 --> 26:51.160
It really was a bug.

494
26:51.750 --> 26:54.410
Could it be someone from the sect running a scam?

495
26:59.270 --> 27:02.330
Could it be a misunderstanding between our own people?

496
27:05.760 --> 27:07.600
This is the Zhang family's ancestral tomb.

497
27:07.600 --> 27:10.000
Maybe it's really a soul-trapping ritual.

498
27:10.380 --> 27:11.340
Liang.

499
27:13.710 --> 27:15.790
[Xijiao]

500
27:17.770 --> 27:18.530
Liang.

501
27:24.710 --> 27:25.920
Liu Xi...

502
27:28.960 --> 27:29.680
L-Liang...

503
27:30.160 --> 27:31.230
Liang!

504
27:31.260 --> 27:31.920
Liang, are you going?

505
27:31.920 --> 27:32.990
I'm going to the Zhang family to ask them!

506
27:32.990 --> 27:34.030
Liang! Liang!

507
27:34.030 --> 27:34.960
Listen to me!

508
27:34.960 --> 27:35.990
If you rush over there recklessly,

509
27:35.990 --> 27:37.470
you won't get any answers.

510
27:37.500 --> 27:38.310
Didn't you tell me?

511
27:38.310 --> 27:39.360
This trap is aimed at me.

512
27:39.360 --> 27:40.470
Calm down first.

513
27:40.910 --> 27:41.950
Li Yingjuan...

514
27:42.550 --> 27:44.360
Li Yingjuan should know a lot about the Zhang family.

515
27:44.360 --> 27:45.640
Let's go find her and ask for details.

516
27:45.640 --> 27:46.920
Every wrong has its cause, and every debt has its debtor.

517
27:46.920 --> 27:48.840
If this is really related to the Zhang family,

518
27:48.840 --> 27:50.120
I'll help you

519
27:50.470 --> 27:51.880
without you even asking.

520
27:56.310 --> 27:57.160
Ma'am,

521
27:57.270 --> 27:59.330
what exactly is this soul-trapping?

522
28:00.230 --> 28:01.070
Ma'am!

523
28:15.640 --> 28:16.500
She's not dead.

524
28:16.920 --> 28:18.050
She just passed out.

525
28:18.990 --> 28:20.250
Shangguan Chengming.

526
28:24.600 --> 28:25.790
I knew you'd come.

527
28:26.160 --> 28:29.820
The master the Zhang family hired is actually you, Second Master?

528
28:31.750 --> 28:32.680
Big Teapot.

529
28:33.600 --> 28:35.710
You're still tough as nails.

530
28:35.740 --> 28:38.220
My poison didn't even take you down.

531
28:38.550 --> 28:41.120
Looks like I went too easy on you.

532
28:41.920 --> 28:42.710
What?

533
28:43.200 --> 28:44.200
Are you mad?

534
28:44.710 --> 28:46.970
You're not even greeting your grandmaster?

535
28:46.970 --> 28:47.760
Tell you what.

536
28:47.760 --> 28:49.200
I'll apologize to you.

537
28:53.120 --> 28:54.470
I'm talking to you.

538
28:55.960 --> 28:57.090
Cat got your tongue?

539
28:57.840 --> 28:58.750
Silly Liang.

540
29:03.120 --> 29:03.990
Second Master.

541
29:08.840 --> 29:12.390
These days, any kind of trash can join the sect.

542
29:13.920 --> 29:16.380
You have quite the appetite, Second Master.

543
29:16.440 --> 29:18.230
From the Zhangs to the Lis.

544
29:19.710 --> 29:21.600
Is one family not enough for you?

545
29:21.600 --> 29:22.750
You know nothing.

546
29:23.200 --> 29:24.640
This is a double-sided scam.

547
29:24.640 --> 29:27.550
It's just playing both sides for profit.

548
29:27.780 --> 29:28.960
What's so hard to understand?

549
29:28.960 --> 29:32.040
This scam was passed down by the old Sect Master.

550
29:32.300 --> 29:32.990
The current Sect Master

551
29:32.990 --> 29:34.990
became the Sect Master

552
29:35.160 --> 29:37.200
because he took on this scam.

553
29:37.230 --> 29:39.270
Then I should congratulate you, Second Master.

554
29:39.270 --> 29:40.880
If this double-sided scam is so important,

555
29:40.880 --> 29:43.230
why did the Li family come to me?

556
29:43.880 --> 29:45.470
This double-sided scam

557
29:45.880 --> 29:46.960
requires killing.

558
29:50.600 --> 29:51.730
Do you have the guts?

559
29:53.960 --> 29:55.230
Greenhorn.

560
29:56.990 --> 29:59.190
To perform this soul-trapping ritual,

561
29:59.750 --> 30:02.230
you need to stuff a living person

562
30:02.790 --> 30:04.920
into a water vat.

563
30:06.310 --> 30:07.470
And then,

564
30:07.600 --> 30:08.840
you drown her...

565
30:10.840 --> 30:11.970
with your own hands.

566
30:12.920 --> 30:13.990
Fifty years ago,

567
30:14.590 --> 30:16.890
the Li family kept making things difficult for our old Sect Master.

568
30:16.890 --> 30:17.720
Seal the soul.

569
30:17.960 --> 30:18.920
He had no choice

570
30:18.950 --> 30:21.870
but to use the soul-trapping ritual.

571
30:25.030 --> 30:26.200
All these years,

572
30:26.280 --> 30:29.030
it wasn't just Miss Zhang's soul that was trapped, right?

573
30:29.030 --> 30:29.990
The Zhang family

574
30:30.440 --> 30:31.440
and the Li family—

575
30:31.840 --> 30:33.320
both families have shed quite a lot of blood.

576
30:33.320 --> 30:36.450
This soul-trapping ritual actually worked every time?

577
30:36.640 --> 30:38.430
Ever since the first time it was performed,

578
30:38.430 --> 30:40.710
the Li family's eldest son, Li Yingfu,

579
30:41.030 --> 30:43.600
has risen through the ranks and landed a government position.

580
30:43.600 --> 30:45.070
As long as it works once,

581
30:45.160 --> 30:46.440
everyone will think

582
30:46.510 --> 30:48.310
it's all thanks to the soul-trapping ritual.

583
30:48.310 --> 30:50.840
The Zhang family was jealous of the Li family.

584
30:52.160 --> 30:54.020
The wicked prey on the destitute.

585
30:54.790 --> 30:58.550
The Zhang family also asked the Sect Master to perform the soul-trapping ritual.

586
30:58.550 --> 31:00.400
So he conveniently turned

587
31:00.400 --> 31:03.270
the soul-trapping rituals of both families

588
31:03.400 --> 31:04.860
into a double-sided scam.

589
31:06.120 --> 31:07.250
The old Sect Master—

590
31:07.600 --> 31:08.400
I respect him.

591
31:08.470 --> 31:10.230
But our current Sect Master

592
31:10.880 --> 31:12.120
is quite something.

593
31:13.160 --> 31:16.030
He made the Zhang and Li families, who were once close,

594
31:16.030 --> 31:17.470
grow suspicious of,

595
31:17.600 --> 31:18.840
envious of,

596
31:18.840 --> 31:20.400
and hateful toward each other.

597
31:20.400 --> 31:21.840
The desires in their hearts

598
31:21.840 --> 31:23.790
are like algae at the bottom of a river,

599
31:23.790 --> 31:25.310
tangling tighter and tighter.

600
31:25.310 --> 31:28.440
The more they hate each other, the more the sect profits.

601
31:29.070 --> 31:30.470
I'm just curious about one thing.

602
31:30.470 --> 31:32.550
This soul-trapping scam has lasted for 50 years.

603
31:32.550 --> 31:34.750
The Zhang and Li families have trapped so many girls.

604
31:34.750 --> 31:36.440
Has there never been any trouble?

605
31:36.440 --> 31:37.310
Good question.

606
31:37.840 --> 31:38.680
Today,

607
31:38.790 --> 31:40.750
I'll explain it to you in detail.

608
31:41.960 --> 31:43.680
Actually, it's not just the girls

609
31:43.680 --> 31:46.880
from the Zhang and Li families who were trapped.

610
31:47.000 --> 31:47.890
There are also

611
31:47.920 --> 31:50.070
the girls from Yuehaitang.

612
31:51.580 --> 31:54.300
Speaking of which, I feel sorry for those girls.

613
31:54.560 --> 31:56.430
Such beautiful girls,

614
31:56.530 --> 32:00.930
yet their lives are worth less than the dogs used for spiritual cons in the sect.

615
32:01.470 --> 32:02.990
Sometimes I think

616
32:03.510 --> 32:04.880
the Fifth Batou

617
32:04.940 --> 32:07.110
is really ruthless.

618
32:07.680 --> 32:08.880
They were all...

619
32:09.270 --> 32:09.710
Silly Liang!

620
32:09.710 --> 32:10.970
Shangguan Chengming!

621
32:11.120 --> 32:11.920
Is he crazy?

622
32:11.950 --> 32:12.830
I'm telling you,

623
32:12.830 --> 32:14.030
keep an eye on him!

624
32:14.230 --> 32:16.400
This case is the legacy of our Tianxiang Sect.

625
32:16.400 --> 32:17.790
If you dare to make a move against it,

626
32:17.790 --> 32:20.120
the Sect Master will definitely kill you.

627
32:22.920 --> 32:23.840
Jiang Feiyan!

628
32:26.960 --> 32:27.990
Jiang Feiyan!

629
32:28.990 --> 32:31.030
Jiang Feiyan, come out here!

630
32:32.030 --> 32:32.840
Jiang Feiyan!

631
32:32.920 --> 32:34.050
Why are you yelling?

632
32:34.710 --> 32:35.680
Jiang Feiyan,

633
32:35.880 --> 32:37.120
you jinx!

634
32:37.150 --> 32:38.300
Liang!

635
32:38.400 --> 32:40.550
You watched our brothers and sisters in the sect die without doing anything!

636
32:40.550 --> 32:42.600
Did the blood wine you drank at the altar mean nothing to you?

637
32:42.600 --> 32:43.750
Calm down, Liang!

638
32:43.750 --> 32:44.880
I can't calm down!

639
32:45.270 --> 32:47.650
The woman I love died an unexplained death,

640
32:47.650 --> 32:48.880
and it was all because of her!

641
32:48.880 --> 32:50.540
What are you going crazy over?

642
32:51.160 --> 32:52.560
What is he talking about?

643
32:52.650 --> 32:54.400
Was there a girl named Liu Xijiao

644
32:54.400 --> 32:56.030
in Yuehaitang before?

645
32:59.680 --> 33:01.140
Yes, there was such a girl.

646
33:01.200 --> 33:03.020
And there were Lin Wan'er, Song Xue'e,

647
33:03.020 --> 33:04.300
and many others.

648
33:04.510 --> 33:05.600
It was all the sect's arrangement.

649
33:05.600 --> 33:07.660
You used them all for soul-trapping?

650
33:08.510 --> 33:09.400
That's right.

651
33:09.680 --> 33:11.630
I handled every single one of them myself.

652
33:11.630 --> 33:13.280
What right do you have to act up here?

653
33:13.280 --> 33:14.170
Get out of here.

654
33:14.930 --> 33:16.000
You're too ruthless!

655
33:16.000 --> 33:16.810
Liang!

656
33:26.600 --> 33:29.130
How are things on the Zhang family's side now?

657
33:29.680 --> 33:32.480
The wedding and the ritual have all been prepared.

658
33:33.600 --> 33:36.060
Shangguan Chengming is already in the game.

659
33:36.960 --> 33:38.790
You need to teach him a good lesson.

660
33:38.790 --> 33:39.270
Yes.

661
33:39.640 --> 33:41.210
But with you at the Zhang family,

662
33:41.210 --> 33:42.270
I can rest assured.

663
33:45.120 --> 33:45.710
By the way,

664
33:45.710 --> 33:47.640
I found a little something for you.

665
33:49.160 --> 33:49.960
A Xuande Jar?

666
33:50.840 --> 33:52.880
It's in better condition than yours, right?

667
33:52.880 --> 33:53.270
Yes,

668
33:53.710 --> 33:54.910
much better, Master.

669
33:56.200 --> 33:56.790
Master,

670
33:56.900 --> 33:58.790
you're the only one who'd remember

671
33:58.790 --> 34:00.070
such a little thing for me.

672
34:00.070 --> 34:01.790
I really love it.

673
34:02.200 --> 34:03.600
Then keep it and enjoy it.

674
34:06.360 --> 34:07.490
Sixth Batou is here.

675
34:07.640 --> 34:09.130
Then I'll take my leave first, Master.

676
34:09.130 --> 34:09.659
Alright.

677
34:15.340 --> 34:16.030
Master.

678
34:22.110 --> 34:24.770
Shangguan Chengming went to find Jiang Feiyan.

679
34:26.360 --> 34:28.239
Now that all the players are here,

680
34:28.460 --> 34:30.100
the show can begin.

681
34:36.340 --> 34:38.000
[Zhang Residence]

682
34:43.290 --> 34:44.969
[Zhang Yinhua]

683
34:45.989 --> 34:48.239
Here they come!

684
34:49.190 --> 34:51.440
Congratulations!

685
34:52.440 --> 34:55.510
Master, the Young Master is here!

686
34:55.020 --> 34:57.210
[Zhang Yuanfan]

687
34:55.510 --> 34:56.800
Congratulations!

688
35:18.760 --> 35:20.420
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

689
35:22.110 --> 35:23.570
Second bow to the parents!

690
35:25.990 --> 35:27.990
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

691
35:31.110 --> 35:32.970
The newlyweds will now serve tea!

692
35:56.840 --> 35:58.440
Congratulations, Master Zhang.

693
35:58.440 --> 35:59.800
Congratulations!

694
35:59.850 --> 36:01.710
Congratulations, Master Zhang!

695
36:13.550 --> 36:15.210
When you get to the other side,

696
36:15.710 --> 36:17.910
I will burn plenty of joss paper for you.

697
36:19.280 --> 36:21.070
You must also bless our family

698
36:21.550 --> 36:23.110
with wealth, glory,

699
36:23.800 --> 36:25.510
happiness, and longevity.

700
37:11.010 --> 37:11.810
Seal the soul!

701
38:07.070 --> 38:08.160
The ritual is complete.

702
38:08.160 --> 38:09.490
Congratulations, Master Zhang.

703
38:09.490 --> 38:11.690
You've gained another 10 years of life.

704
38:18.920 --> 38:20.240
I'm recovered.

705
38:22.190 --> 38:23.510
I can feel it.

706
38:24.630 --> 38:25.990
I can feel it!

707
38:36.210 --> 38:38.000
[Li Ling]

708
38:38.950 --> 38:41.620
[Li Residence]

709
39:05.990 --> 39:07.200
For this scam to work,

710
39:07.630 --> 39:10.090
the ritual needs to look like it's complete.

711
39:10.440 --> 39:12.640
So those girls have to be put in the vats.

712
39:13.960 --> 39:15.420
Because the fools who paid

713
39:15.760 --> 39:17.690
will check if they are really dead.

714
39:17.890 --> 39:18.600
As for

715
39:18.630 --> 39:19.630
the soul-trapping nails,

716
39:19.630 --> 39:22.030
they are fake ones I had the Fourth Batou make in advance.

717
39:22.030 --> 39:23.830
Nailing them in won't kill them.

718
39:23.920 --> 39:24.990
We just need to fool those people first.

719
39:24.990 --> 39:26.190
So that means

720
39:27.150 --> 39:28.630
Liu Xijiao is still alive.

721
39:28.800 --> 39:29.800
Where is she?

722
39:30.150 --> 39:31.150
Even if I tell you,

723
39:32.320 --> 39:33.920
you can't go looking for her.

724
39:34.190 --> 39:36.360
According to the rules of the Tianxiang Sect,

725
39:36.360 --> 39:37.760
you should know very well

726
39:37.990 --> 39:40.050
how they will treat me and those girls

727
39:40.400 --> 39:41.660
who have left the sect,

728
39:42.720 --> 39:44.320
and what will happen to them.

729
39:44.470 --> 39:45.070
So,

730
39:46.880 --> 39:49.210
you've been saving these girls all along?

731
39:51.960 --> 39:53.760
These girls have had a hard life.

732
39:53.800 --> 39:54.800
Someone has to

733
39:55.470 --> 39:57.330
shield them from some disasters.

734
39:58.280 --> 39:59.150
However...

735
40:00.630 --> 40:02.290
how did you end up in this scam?

736
40:05.360 --> 40:06.560
It's the Sect Master.

737
40:14.070 --> 40:14.470
Yanzi,

738
40:14.880 --> 40:16.010
where have you been?

739
40:16.190 --> 40:17.550
I was worried about Shangguan Chengming

740
40:17.550 --> 40:18.630
being involved in the scam.

741
40:18.630 --> 40:20.760
With you gone, I felt even more uneasy.

742
40:21.240 --> 40:23.150
What are you saying, Second Master?

743
40:23.150 --> 40:25.950
I just went to prepare some dishes for your drinks.

744
40:27.510 --> 40:28.840
You're the best to me.

745
40:43.470 --> 40:44.280
Yanzi,

746
40:44.550 --> 40:46.470
if we could be

747
40:46.470 --> 40:47.190
of one mind

748
40:47.800 --> 40:49.070
from now on,

749
40:49.470 --> 40:51.470
imagine how good our meals would be.

750
40:53.720 --> 40:54.550
Just eat.

751
41:11.280 --> 41:11.990
Master!

752
41:21.320 --> 41:22.250
Have some water.

753
41:27.630 --> 41:28.490
Master, you...

754
41:31.760 --> 41:34.030
The ritual has just been completed.

755
41:36.280 --> 41:37.550
Why is my health

756
41:38.110 --> 41:40.070
getting worse?

757
41:40.240 --> 41:40.720
Well...

758
42:09.880 --> 42:10.470
Master!

759
42:13.510 --> 42:14.070
Master!

760
42:15.240 --> 42:15.990
Where is she?

761
42:16.470 --> 42:17.440
Where is Li Ling?

762
42:17.440 --> 42:17.960
Well...

763
42:18.840 --> 42:19.590
I'll go

764
42:19.590 --> 42:21.400
bring that witch over here right now!

765
42:21.400 --> 42:22.320
Follow me!

766
42:36.320 --> 42:36.980
Who are you?

767
42:37.190 --> 42:38.770
How dare you brandish weapons in Zhang Residence?

768
42:38.770 --> 42:39.850
Cut the crap.

769
42:40.070 --> 42:41.200
Take her away!

770
42:41.300 --> 42:42.300
Don't touch her!

771
42:44.360 --> 42:45.400
Catch them!

772
42:54.280 --> 42:55.140
Second Master!

773
42:59.630 --> 43:00.490
Take them away.

774
43:01.550 --> 43:02.150
Move!

775
43:02.400 --> 43:02.750
Hurry up!

776
43:02.750 --> 43:03.360
Move!

777
43:07.590 --> 43:08.240
Here.

778
43:08.670 --> 43:09.760
Have some water.

779
43:10.110 --> 43:11.190
Don't worry.

780
43:11.190 --> 43:11.990
Once the boat arrives

781
43:11.990 --> 43:13.400
and Chengming settles things with the captain,

782
43:13.400 --> 43:15.000
we'll get you out of Yucheng.

783
43:17.960 --> 43:18.960
It will be fine.

784
43:19.840 --> 43:20.770
Have some water.

785
43:53.160 --> 43:55.470
[In the next episode]

786
43:55.540 --> 43:57.630
What are you doing, Second Master?

787
43:58.760 --> 43:59.900
With that brat around,

788
43:59.900 --> 44:01.280
he'll drag you down with him sooner or later.

789
44:01.280 --> 44:02.140
Second Master!

790
44:02.360 --> 44:04.280
Jiang Feiyan saved Li Ling?

791
44:04.360 --> 44:05.640
She exposed the scam.

792
44:05.680 --> 44:07.210
Between Li Ling and Feiyan,

793
44:07.310 --> 44:08.940
you can only save one.

794
44:09.760 --> 44:10.550
Feiyan!

795
44:11.070 --> 44:11.880
Watch out!

796
44:14.190 --> 44:14.990
Second Master!

797
44:14.990 --> 44:16.390
Look carefully! It's me!

798
44:16.620 --> 44:17.910
Brat!

799
44:18.400 --> 44:20.130
You're the one I'm here to kill!

800
44:20.840 --> 44:22.030
Interesting.

801
44:22.430 --> 44:24.630
When do you think the fish will take the bait?
